        "type": "game",
        "name": "Job Battle Simulator",
        "steam_appid": 3671980,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are an office worker hiding in the toilet, don't hide anymore or fight with the boss throwing toilet paper at his face.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IF THERE WAS A WAR BETWEEN JOBS, WHICH JOB WOULD WIN?</h2><br>Try to create your team and see which profession will be the champion.<br>is a game based on a realistic (and crazy) physics engine. Players can choose from a variety of character classes and engage in a chaotic team fight. Exaggeration, absurdity, chaos, mayhem, brawls, parodies, humor and wit are the highlights of this game. Character class battles bring unexpected attacks and skills, while realistic physics create chaotic, unpredictable flying moves. The game is compact and fun, bringing entertainment, adding a bit of liveliness. The game boasts a surprisingly diverse character class system, each class has its own unique attacks and skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2>The game offers single-player and free sandbox modes. Sandbox mode allows players to freely choose the map, assign character classes to opponents and then engage in a chaotic battle. As for the single-player challenge, there are 100 levels. Each level requires players to choose the appropriate character class and deploy in the appropriate position, based on the maximum number of players. Players can choose to fight automatically or control a single player to actively fight. New character classes will be unlocked as the stages progress. Although<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUTSTANDING FEATURES</h2>- 26 crazy professions with each character being a profession with a unique, weird and absurd way of attacking,<br>- Endless combinations: Mix professions to create weird combos and humorous disasters<br>- Many arenas: From offices, construction sites to supermarkets...<br>- Replay mode: Save and share funny moments as GIFs or videos<br>- Each match is a unique, unrepeatable, humorous physical performance that can become a viral clip",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are an office worker hiding in the toilet, don't hide anymore or fight with the boss throwing toilet paper at his face.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IF THERE WAS A WAR BETWEEN JOBS, WHICH JOB WOULD WIN?</h2><br>Try to create your team and see which profession will be the champion.<br>is a game based on a realistic (and crazy) physics engine. Players can choose from a variety of character classes and engage in a chaotic team fight. Exaggeration, absurdity, chaos, mayhem, brawls, parodies, humor and wit are the highlights of this game. Character class battles bring unexpected attacks and skills, while realistic physics create chaotic, unpredictable flying moves. The game is compact and fun, bringing entertainment, adding a bit of liveliness. The game boasts a surprisingly diverse character class system, each class has its own unique attacks and skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2>The game offers single-player and free sandbox modes. Sandbox mode allows players to freely choose the map, assign character classes to opponents and then engage in a chaotic battle. As for the single-player challenge, there are 100 levels. Each level requires players to choose the appropriate character class and deploy in the appropriate position, based on the maximum number of players. Players can choose to fight automatically or control a single player to actively fight. New character classes will be unlocked as the stages progress. Although<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUTSTANDING FEATURES</h2>- 26 crazy professions with each character being a profession with a unique, weird and absurd way of attacking,<br>- Endless combinations: Mix professions to create weird combos and humorous disasters<br>- Many arenas: From offices, construction sites to supermarkets...<br>- Replay mode: Save and share funny moments as GIFs or videos<br>- Each match is a unique, unrepeatable, humorous physical performance that can become a viral clip",
